# Implementation Summary

<!-- SPECKIT_LEVEL: 1 -->
<!-- SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE: impl-summary-core | v2.2 -->
<!-- HVR_REFERENCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/references/global/hvr_rules.md -->

